                                        "sense_id": "059b7bad-3b8b-3dc7-af7f-0bae3411ca15",
                                        "entry_id": "31785848-0962-32f1-a94d-b95ab3ff789a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A state of laxity or indulgence; unrestrained freedom, abandonment."
